sequenceDiagram
    participant B1 as "Broker 1<br>(Leader)<br>❌ FAILED"
    participant B2 as "Broker 2<br>(Follower)"
    participant B3 as "Broker 3<br>(Follower)"
    participant KC as "KRaft Controller"

    Note over B1: ❌ Broker 1 Failure
    B1-->>KC: ❌ Heartbeat timeout
    KC->>KC: Detect broker failure
    KC->>KC: Elect new leader
    KC->>B2: ⚡ Promote to leader
    B2->>B2: Become leader
    B2-->>KC: ✅ Acknowledged
    KC->>B3: 📢 Update metadata (new leader: Broker 2)
    KC->>B2: 📢 Update metadata (new leader: Broker 2)
    Note over B2: ⭐ Broker 2<br>NEW LEADER
    B3->>B2: 🔄 Sync data
    Note over B1: ❌ Broker 1<br>(Failed)